{"seq":2,"slug":"edi-observability-reconciliation-metrics","title":"可观测与对账度量：控制号审计、失败分类、SLA/OTIF 看板与告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/b2b-edi-trading-partner-x12-edifact-integration/partner-ops-modernization/edi-observability-reconciliation-metrics","wordCount":3063,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"可观测与对账度量-控制号审计-失败分类-sla-otif-看板与告警\">可观测与对账度量：控制号审计、失败分类、SLA/OTIF 看板与告警</h1><p>一家跨境卖家上线 EDI 三个月后收到零售商扣款：本月 6% 的订单因「ASN 未在发货当日到达」被罚。工程团队的第一反应是「我们每天都发了 856」——但 <code>856</code> 发出去了不等于伙伴收到，收到了不等于解析成功并被 WMS 接收。<strong>EDI 的运维难点不是「能不能传」，而是「传了之后哪一层断了」</strong>，这需要一套结构化可观测体系：用控制号对账把发出去的报文与进入对方系统的单据对齐，把错误码收敛成可归因的失败分类，再把交易集状态翻译成 SLA/OTIF 指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-edi-可观测性的三层证据链\">核心概念：EDI 可观测性的三层证据链</h2><p>EDI 的「成功」从来不是单一事件，而是<strong>三段可独立观测的证据</strong>串成的链。传输层证据是 AS2 <code>MDN</code>（消息处置通知，RFC 4130）或 AS4 的 <code>Receipt</code>，只证明「对方网关收到了载荷并完成签名解验」；语法层证据是 997/999（X12）或 CONTRL（EDIFACT），证明「翻译器解开信封且段/元素结构合规」；业务层证据是对方系统状态——订单进入 <code>Open</code>、ASN 挂到对应 PO、发票进入应付流程，这层往往没有 EDI 回执，只能靠对账推断。三层边界是整套监控的基石：<strong>MDN 200 OK 从来不代表伙伴业务系统接受了你的单据</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SEND[&quot;我方发送&lt;br/&gt;ISA/GS/ST 信封&quot;] --&gt; AS2[&quot;AS2/AS4 传输&quot;]&#10;    AS2 --&gt;|同步或异步| MDN[&quot;MDN / AS4 Receipt&lt;br/&gt;传输层证据&quot;]&#10;    AS2 --&gt;|HTTP 超时 / 4xx| TFAIL[&quot;传输失败&lt;br/&gt;可安全重传&quot;]&#10;    MDN --&gt;|对端翻译器解析| ACK[&quot;997/999 或 CONTRL&lt;br/&gt;语法层证据&quot;]&#10;    ACK --&gt;|AK5=R / IK5=R| SFAIL[&quot;结构拒绝&lt;br/&gt;需人工修复&quot;]&#10;    ACK --&gt;|AK5=A / IK5=A| BIZ[&quot;对方业务系统&lt;br/&gt;WMS / ERP / AP&quot;]&#10;    BIZ --&gt;|无 EDI 回执| RECON[&quot;业务层对账&lt;br/&gt;按 PO 号 / ASN 号匹配&quot;]&#10;    RECON --&gt;|对不上| OFFSET[&quot;缺件 / 重复 / 挂错 PO&quot;]\">graph TD\n    SEND[\"我方发送&lt;br/&gt;ISA/GS/ST 信封\"] --&gt; AS2[\"AS2/AS4 传输\"]\n    AS2 --&gt;|同步或异步| MDN[\"MDN / AS4 Receipt&lt;br/&gt;传输层证据\"]\n    AS2 --&gt;|HTTP 超时 / 4xx| TFAIL[\"传输失败&lt;br/&gt;可安全重传\"]\n    MDN --&gt;|对端翻译器解析| ACK[\"997/999 或 CONTRL&lt;br/&gt;语法层证据\"]\n    ACK --&gt;|AK5=R / IK5=R| SFAIL[\"结构拒绝&lt;br/&gt;需人工修复\"]\n    ACK --&gt;|AK5=A / IK5=A| BIZ[\"对方业务系统&lt;br/&gt;WMS / ERP / AP\"]\n    BIZ --&gt;|无 EDI 回执| RECON[\"业务层对账&lt;br/&gt;按 PO 号 / ASN 号匹配\"]\n    RECON --&gt;|对不上| OFFSET[\"缺件 / 重复 / 挂错 PO\"]</pre><p>对账的本质是把三层的标识符串起来。X12 有 <code>ISA13</code>（交换控制号）、<code>GS06</code>（组控制号）、<code>ST02</code>（交易集控制号）三级，AS2 层另有独立的 <code>Message-ID</code>（RFC 4130 要求其在 AS2-From/AS2-To 上下文内唯一），EDIFACT 侧对应 <code>UNB</code> 的 <code>0020</code>、<code>UNG</code> 的 <code>0048</code>、<code>UNH</code> 的 <code>0062</code>。<strong>控制号必须成对存储</strong>：发送侧存我方生成的号，收到确认后用 <code>TA101</code>、997 的 <code>AK1</code>/<code>AK2</code>、CONTRL 的 <code>UCI</code>/<code>UCM</code> 回引对端引用号，两条记录用交换号 join，才构成一次完整交换的闭环。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>观测层</th>\n<th>证据载体</th>\n<th>证明什么</th>\n<th>不能证明什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>AS2 MDN / AS4 Receipt</td>\n<td>载荷送达、签名解验通过</td>\n<td>报文结构是否合法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语法层</td>\n<td>997 / 999 / CONTRL</td>\n<td>信封与段/元素合规</td>\n<td>业务字段是否被接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务层</td>\n<td>对方系统状态（需对账）</td>\n<td>单据进入对方流程</td>\n<td>无 EDI 通道，只能推断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"控制号审计-从-isa13-到-as2-message-id-的对账\">控制号审计：从 ISA13 到 AS2 Message-ID 的对账</h2><p>控制号审计的第一件事是<strong>建立交换台账</strong>。每行代表一次交换，主键是我方 <code>ISA13</code>（配合 <code>ISA05/06</code> 发送方 ID 与 <code>ISA07/08</code> 接收方 ID），字段含发送时间、AS2 <code>Message-ID</code>、<code>MDN</code> 到达时间与状态、997/999 到达时间与 <code>AK9</code>/<code>IK5</code> 码、业务层对账结果。它是后续所有指标与告警的数据源——<strong>没有台账，监控只能看日志行数，而日志行数既不能归因也不能对账</strong>。</p>\n<p>第一类异常是<strong>控制号跳号与重用</strong>。X12 不强制控制号连续，但多数伙伴的指南要求单调递增；一旦不递增，主流 VAN/EDI 平台（SPS Commerce、OpenText 等）的去重逻辑可能把重传判为重复交换，回 <code>TA105=025</code> 或 CONTRL <code>0085=26</code>。因此号分配须是<strong>事务内原子序列</strong>，重传时<strong>换新号、保留业务单号</strong>——详见本 hub 的 <a href=\"../transport-security-reliability/reliable-delivery-retry-idempotency\">可靠投递、重试与幂等</a>。</p>\n<p>第二类异常是<strong>回引断裂</strong>：收到了 997，但 <code>AK1</code> 里的组控制号在台账里找不到对应发送记录；或 <code>TA101</code> 引用的 <code>ISA13</code> 早已关闭。根因通常有三——对端把两个交换的确认合并、我方台账写入失败丢记录、对端重发旧确认。判据是统计「孤儿确认」与「超时未确认」两个集合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>orphanAck</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>∣</mo><mtext>ack.ref</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mtext>ledger</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>unacked</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>l</mi><mo>∣</mo><mtext>age</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>ack</mtext></msub><mo>∧</mo><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>ack</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{orphanAck} = \\{\\, a \\mid \\text{ack.ref} \\notin \\text{ledger} \\,\\}, \\qquad \\text{unacked} = \\{\\, l \\mid \\text{age}(l) &gt; T_{\\text{ack}} \\land l.\\text{ack} = \\varnothing \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">orphanAck</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ack.ref</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ledger</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">unacked</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">age</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ack</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ack</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>unacked</code> 是<strong>告警主战场</strong>：超出约定窗口仍无确认的交换，要么对端静默丢包，要么 AS2 发送成功但 MDN 未落库。按 <code>AS2-From/AS2-To</code> 分组统计两者，就能把「哪家伙伴回执最不靠谱」变成可排序的数字。</p>\n<p>第三类异常是<strong>数量对不齐</strong>。997 的 <code>AK9</code> 携带 <code>AK902</code>（实收数）、<code>AK903</code>（已接收）、<code>AK904</code>（已接受），<code>AK902</code> 必须等于本次实际发出的交易集数；不等则说明对端在组层丢包，或我方 <code>GE02</code> 计数与 <code>ST</code> 数量不符。EDIFACT 侧由 CONTRL 的 <code>0085=29</code> 兜底。段级下钻见本 hub 的 <a href=\"../mapping-ack-validation-integration/functional-ack-997-999-ta1\">功能确认与错误报告</a>，本文只关心统计与告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败分类-把数百个错误码收敛成可归因的错误预算\">失败分类：把数百个错误码收敛成可归因的错误预算</h2><p>把 <code>AK304=7</code>、<code>AK404=1</code>、<code>TA105=004</code>、CONTRL <code>0085=12</code> 这些原始码直接打到大屏，值班的同学只会看到一片噪音。必须做一次<strong>分类收敛</strong>，把错误码映射到行动方式不同的桶里。分类维度不是「哪个码」，而是**「谁该修、怎么修」<strong>——同桶错误的 runbook 处置动作应一致。下按</strong>错误归属<strong>切三刀、按</strong>是否可自动恢复**切一刀：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败桶</th>\n<th>典型码</th>\n<th>归属</th>\n<th>处置动作</th>\n<th>可否自动重传</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输失败</td>\n<td>HTTP 5xx/超时、连接重置、CONTRL <code>0085=41/42</code></td>\n<td>双方网络/网关</td>\n<td>自动指数退避重传</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分隔符协商错</td>\n<td><code>TA105=004/026/027</code></td>\n<td>接入配置</td>\n<td>修正 ISA 分隔符并重发</td>\n<td>否（需改配置）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发送方/接收方 ID 错</td>\n<td><code>TA105=005..009</code></td>\n<td>接入配置</td>\n<td>核对 ISA05-08 与伙伴备案</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制号重复</td>\n<td><code>TA105=025</code>、<code>0085=26</code></td>\n<td>我方序列生成</td>\n<td>查重传逻辑是否换号</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>段结构错</td>\n<td><code>AK304=1..7,10</code></td>\n<td>映射/指南偏差</td>\n<td>按 <code>AK302</code> 段位置修映射</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元素/UOM/代码值错</td>\n<td><code>AK404=1..16</code>、999 的 <code>I6/I10/I11</code></td>\n<td>数据质量/主数据</td>\n<td>修正源数据或加校验</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现层不合规</td>\n<td>999 的 <code>IK403=I6/I9</code></td>\n<td>伙伴实施指南</td>\n<td>对齐指南允许集</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的关键产出是**「可否自动重传」这一列**，它把 pipeline 重试逻辑从「无脑重试」收缩为「只对传输失败重试」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>retryable</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext>bucket</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>transport</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{retryable}(f) = \\big[\\, f.\\text{bucket} = \\text{transport} \\,\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">retryable</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bucket</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">transport</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>结构性错误（分隔符、ID、段、元素、实现层）自动重传绝不会成功，只会把对端的重复报文告警刷爆。把这条判据写进代码比写进 runbook 更可靠——凌晨三点的值班同学不会记得它。</p>\n<p>分类之上再叠一层<strong>错误预算</strong>：给每家伙伴设本月结构性拒绝率上限（如 0.5%），超出即触发集成健康度 review 而非单条告警。降噪的另一维度是<strong>幂等键去重</strong>：同一业务单号在同一时间窗内的重复错误事件应合并计数，否则一次批量重传会把错误率瞬时抬高十倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sla-otif-看板-从交易集状态到业务指标\">SLA/OTIF 看板：从交易集状态到业务指标</h2><p>零售与快消场景里，技术团队最终要交付<strong>运营语言</strong>的指标，最典型的是 <strong>OTIF（On-Time In-Full，准时足量）</strong>。北美大型零售商的供应商合规项目（如 Walmart 与 Target 的 vendor compliance 罚款计划）把 OTIF 直接与扣款挂钩，达标线通常在 90%–98% 区间，未达标按订单或按件计罚。EDI 层的 856（ASN）与 810（发票）是否及时准确，直接决定这些罚款是否发生。</p>\n<p>把 EDI 状态翻译成 OTIF 需要一条映射链。OTIF 是两个比率的乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>OTIF</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>On-Time</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>In-Full</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>On-Time</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∣</mo><mtext>delivered</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mtext>DD</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>In-Full</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>∣</mo><mtext>qty</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>ordered</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{OTIF} = \\text{On-Time} \\times \\text{In-Full}, \\quad \\text{On-Time} = \\frac{\\#\\{d \\mid \\text{delivered}(d) \\le \\text{DD}(d)\\}}{\\#\\{d\\}}, \\quad \\text{In-Full} = \\frac{\\#\\{d \\mid \\text{qty}(d) = \\text{ordered}(d)\\}}{\\#\\{d\\}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OTIF</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">On-Time</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">In-Full</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">On-Time</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">delivered</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DD</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">In-Full</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">qty</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ordered</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>EDI 侧贡献的可观测信号是：<strong>ASN 时点</strong>（856 须在发货当日、有时须在承运人提货前到达）、<strong>ASN-PO 匹配率</strong>（856 的 <code>PRF</code>/<code>PO1</code> 引用能否对上 850 的 <code>PO1</code>）、<strong>810 金额与 850 价格一致性</strong>。注意「准时」以<strong>实际收货时点</strong>为准而非 ASN 发出时点，但 ASN 迟到会连锁导致收货记录缺失、被判不达标。所以看板要把「ASN 时点相对发货日期的偏移」当<strong>先行指标</strong>，把 OTIF 当<strong>滞后指标</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>面向</th>\n<th>阈值示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ACK 时延 P95</td>\n<td>从发送到收到 997/999 的 P95 小时数</td>\n<td>交换台账</td>\n<td>工程</td>\n<td>&lt; 4h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构性拒绝率</td>\n<td>非传输类失败 / 总交易集</td>\n<td>失败分类</td>\n<td>工程</td>\n<td>&lt; 0.5% / 月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MDN 成功率</td>\n<td>返回有效 MDN 的交换 / 总交换</td>\n<td>AS2 日志</td>\n<td>工程</td>\n<td>&gt; 99.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ASN 当日到达率</td>\n<td>发货日当天送达伙伴的 856 占比</td>\n<td>856 时点</td>\n<td>运营</td>\n<td>&gt; 98%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ASN-PO 匹配率</td>\n<td>能挂到 850 的 856 占比</td>\n<td>业务对账</td>\n<td>运营</td>\n<td>&gt; 99%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OTIF</td>\n<td>准时率 × 足量率</td>\n<td>收货 + 850 比对</td>\n<td>财务/高层</td>\n<td>&gt; 95%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>看板分层原则是：<strong>工程看先行、运营看过程、财务看结果</strong>。把所有权重码堆在一起的「监控大屏」最没用，因为它不指向任何人的具体动作。更实用的是每家<strong>伙伴一行的记分卡（scorecard）</strong>：一行里同时有 ACK 时延、拒绝率、ASN 准时率、OTIF 贡献，一次 review 就能定位「是这家伙伴网关慢，还是我方映射没对齐它最新的指南」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警与值班-阈值-抑制与-runbook\">告警与值班：阈值、抑制与 runbook</h2><p>告警设计的第一原则是<strong>告警必须对应可执行的动作</strong>；做不到动作的告警应降级为看板项。据此分档：<code>unacked</code> 交换数、结构性拒绝率、MDN 失败率可告警（有明确处置动作）；OTIF 波动不可告警（它是结果，修复周期以天计），只进周报。</p>\n<p>阈值应从<strong>历史基线</strong>推。设某类事件过去 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 天的日频次为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>…</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_1 \\dots x_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>alert if </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i, \\qquad \\sigma = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}(x_i - \\mu)^2}, \\qquad \\text{alert if } x &gt; \\mu + 3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1568em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8791em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5.1168em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.1168em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1.056em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8391em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.1168em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.742em;height:3.1968em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.1968em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3196\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M702 80H40000040\nH742v3062l-4 4-4 4c-.667.7 -2 1.5-4 2.5s-4.167 1.833-6.5 2.5-5.5 1-9.5 1\nh-12l-28-84c-16.667-52-96.667 -294.333-240-727l-212 -643 -85 170\nc-4-3.333-8.333-7.667-13 -13l-13-13l77-155 77-156c66 199.333 139 419.667\n219 661 l218 661zM702 80H400000v40H742z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">alert if </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 规则适合<strong>平稳</strong>的失败类别（如日常元素错误）；对<strong>突发</strong>场景（伙伴网关宕机导致 <code>unacked</code> 暴涨）应改用绝对阈值，因为此时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 本身会被污染。工程上更稳的是<strong>双阈值</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 抓缓慢漂移，绝对阈值抓突发事件。</p>\n<p>第一个关键是<strong>抑制与聚合</strong>。一次伙伴网关故障会同时触发「MDN 失败率高」「unacked 增多」「ACK 时延超限」三条告警，值班会被淹没。正确做法是<strong>按伙伴维度聚合，取最高严重度单条上报</strong>，并设静默窗口（同一伙伴 30 分钟内只再报一次）。这与失败分类里的去重同源：<strong>告警的对象是「一次事件」而非「一个指标」</strong>。</p>\n<p>下一个关键是<strong>每类告警配一段 runbook</strong>，固定四项：先看哪个台账字段（如该伙伴该时间窗的 <code>Message-ID</code> 是否有对应 MDN）、判据是什么（<code>TA105</code> 还是超时）、能自动做什么（是否进重传队列）、升级路径（何时拉伙伴的 EDI 对接人）。runbook 应区分「我方问题」与「伙伴问题」——分隔符/ID/映射错多在我方或接入配置，网关超时与 ID 未备案多在伙伴侧。把交接判断写清楚，能压掉大量「等对方回邮件」的空转时间。</p>\n<p>最后一条常被忽略：<strong>可观测性本身要有可用性指标</strong>。台账写入失败或 AS2 日志轮转丢档，监控就会「因为看不见而看起来一切正常」——这是最危险的故障模式。故应对监控链路自身做心跳：台账每 N 分钟必须有一次写入，否则触发「监控盲区」高危告警。<strong>沉默不等于健康</strong>，这要用代码而非口号兜住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>EDI 可观测性建立在<strong>三层证据链</strong>上：MDN（传输）、997/999 或 CONTRL（语法）、业务对账（业务）；任一层都不能越权代表下一层。</li>\n<li><strong>交换台账</strong>是对账地基，主键是我方 <code>ISA13</code> 并关联 AS2 <code>Message-ID</code> 与对端回引号；控制号审计盯跳号/重用、回引断裂、数量不符三类异常。</li>\n<li><strong>失败分类</strong>按「谁该修」收敛错误码，输出关键判据：只有传输类失败才进重传队列，结构性错误盲目重传只会放大故障。</li>\n<li><strong>SLA/OTIF 看板</strong>把 EDI 状态翻译成运营与财务语言，遵循「工程看先行、运营看过程、财务看结果」，用伙伴记分卡替代堆码大屏。</li>\n<li><strong>告警</strong>只保留可执行项，用双阈值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> + 绝对阈值）抓漂移与突发，按伙伴聚合抑制风暴，每类告警配四项式 runbook。</li>\n<li>给监控自身设心跳：<strong>沉默不等于健康</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可观测与对账度量：控制号审计、失败分类、SLA/OTIF 看板与告警","id":"可观测与对账度量-控制号审计-失败分类-sla-otif-看板与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：EDI 可观测性的三层证据链","id":"核心概念-edi-可观测性的三层证据链"},{"level":2,"text":"控制号审计：从 ISA13 到 AS2 Message-ID 的对账","id":"控制号审计-从-isa13-到-as2-message-id-的对账"},{"level":2,"text":"失败分类：把数百个错误码收敛成可归因的错误预算","id":"失败分类-把数百个错误码收敛成可归因的错误预算"},{"level":2,"text":"SLA/OTIF 看板：从交易集状态到业务指标","id":"sla-otif-看板-从交易集状态到业务指标"},{"level":2,"text":"告警与值班：阈值、抑制与 runbook","id":"告警与值班-阈值-抑制与-runbook"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"伙伴入驻与认证联调：证书交换、连通性测试用例集与生产切换检查单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/b2b-edi-trading-partner-x12-edifact-integration/partner-ops-modernization/partner-onboarding-certification"},"next":{"title":"API/EDI 融合与现代化迁移：双跑切换、事件驱动接口与映射资产复用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/b2b-edi-trading-partner-x12-edifact-integration/partner-ops-modernization/api-edi-modernization-migration"}}